3:Tede,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a split journey in Indian Railways?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A split journey divides a travel route into two connecting legs—either within the same train across different station quotas or across two coordinating trains—to find available seats when origin-to-destination direct tickets are waitlisted."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is AI Split Journey?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AI Split Journey is our proprietary algorithm that breaks your trip into two parts if a direct train is waitlisted, finding alternate combinations for both legs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Trayago find alternative tickets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We scan the entire IRCTC network's quota system to find hidden stations where seats are still available, even when your boarding station shows WL."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is booking split tickets allowed under railway reservation rules?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, booking individual valid tickets for each leg of a train journey is fully permissible under Indian Railways rules, provided every ticket is booked through authorized booking channels."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is AI Split Journey safe?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, you travel on the same train or a secure connection, holding two valid IRCTC tickets for your journey."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Trayago calculate PNR confirmation probability?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Trayago evaluates historical confirmation patterns, waitlist types (such as GNWL, RLWL, and PQWL), and seasonal travel demand to provide an estimated probability of confirmation before final chart preparation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How accurate is PNR Prediction?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our PNR prediction uses historical data and machine learning to achieve an accuracy rate of over 92%."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I track live train delays and station arrival times on Trayago?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, you can check real-time running status, current train location, delays, and expected platform arrivals by entering any 5-digit Indian Railways train number on the Live Status tool."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Trayago affiliated with IRCTC?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Trayago is an independent travel intelligence platform and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by IRCTC or Indian Railways."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Trayago issue railway tickets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Trayago provides AI-powered route recommendations and journey intelligence only. Ticket booking is completed through official booking platforms."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Trayago guarantee confirmed tickets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Trayago provides AI-powered route recommendations to improve your chances of finding availability, but cannot guarantee confirmed tickets."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need to pay before searching?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Basic searches are free. You only need to upgrade if you want to use advanced AI Split routing extensively."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why is Trayago different?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We don't just show you waitlists. We actively compute alternative ways to get you to your destination using advanced graph algorithms."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is my data secure?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. We do not store your payment information, and your PNR details are securely hashed and anonymized."}}]}7:X
